title: December 2021

@electoral_reform_ko_talks
# prose-audit: Grade A — Kukiz, Lewica, PiS and KO each enter with a concrete constitutional interest, and the only successful bargain visibly buys independent boundaries, public data, voter access and the referendum rather than generic goodwill.
call: poland_normalize
title: KO asks who draws the single-member districts
subtitle: Two resources buy the constitutional votes, a referendum and rules neither large party can rewrite alone
face-image: img/poland/events/sejm-column-hall.webp
new-page: true
on-arrival: electoral_reform_ko_talks_done = 1

= December 2021 — The constitutional arithmetic

<span class="party party-kukiz"><b>Kukiz</b></span> and <span class="party
party-lewica"><b>Lewica</b></span> can submit an amendment. They cannot produce
the 307 Sejm votes Article 235 requires. <span class="party party-pis"><b>PiS</b></span> is willing to vote for it because its rural
machine and polling lead make plurality seats look profitable, but even the
government, <span class="party party-kukiz"><b>Kukiz</b></span> and the <span
class="party party-lewica"><b>Left</b></span> together remain short. <span
class="party party-ko"><b>KO</b></span> owns the missing
votes and knows it.

[? if electoral_reform_proposal = "mixed_230": <span class="party
party-ko"><b>KO</b></span> can live with the
230-plus-230 compromise, provided the district half cannot be drawn in a party
office.?][? if electoral_reform_proposal = "fptp_460": <span class="party
party-ko"><b>KO</b></span> thinks a united opposition could beat <span
class="party party-pis"><b>PiS</b></span> in one-on-one contests. It still refuses to bet 460
seats on boundaries written by the government.?]

Its terms are an independent commission, equal electorates, published maps and
data, access for voter-nominated candidates, and a nationwide referendum before
the constitutional roll call. The institutional work and the cross-party whip
operation cost two party resources.

- @electoral_reform_ko_accept
- @electoral_reform_ko_refuse

@electoral_reform_ko_accept
title: Pay for the safeguards and give KO the referendum
subtitle: Cost: 2 resources. This is the only route to the constitutional majority.
choose-if: resources >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: The party cannot fund the legal, boundary and parliamentary operation.
on-arrival: resources -= 2; electoral_reform_ko_support = 1; electoral_reform_boundary_safeguards = 1; electoral_reform_opposition_pact_channel = 1; electoral_reform_stage = "ko_compromise"; ko_relation += 4; public_trust += 3; electoral_reform_result = "KO joined the Kukiz–Lewica project after securing a referendum and independent boundaries"; news_headline = "KO supplies the missing constitutional votes for guarded JOW reform"

<span class="party party-ko"><b>KO</b></span> signs a common protocol rather
than joining <span class="party party-kukiz"><b>Kukiz</b></span>'s campaign. Boundaries
must be population-equal and published before adoption; an independent
commission conducts the work; citizens retain a route to nominate candidates;
and the country votes before Parliament changes Article 96.

- @poland_events_2020_11.router: Return to the dated news desk

@electoral_reform_ko_refuse
title: Refuse KO's price and let the project die
subtitle: Keep the resources; Article 96 and proportional elections remain unchanged.
on-arrival: electoral_reform_stage = "failed"; electoral_reform_ko_support = 0; electoral_reform_opposition_pact_channel = 0; electoral_reform_result = "The JOW project failed when Lewica rejected KO's constitutional safeguards"; kukiz_relation -= 12; public_trust -= 2; news_headline = "The Kukiz electoral project dies without KO's votes"

We refuse to let <span class="party party-ko"><b>KO</b></span> turn <span
class="party party-kukiz"><b>Kukiz</b></span>'s demand into its own institutional package.
That also means refusing the only bloc capable of taking the count past 307.
The amendment is never filed and the existing proportional law survives.

- @poland_events_2020_11.router: Return to the dated news desk

